# Calendar

**Chat name:** `Calendar`  
**Sidebar label:** Calendar  
**Agent starter:** `.cursor/agents/calendar.md`

## Sync contract

- Cloud (`app_settings.summit_calendar_events`) is source of truth. Device localStorage is a scratch pad.
- Never write the cache to cloud on boot. Last-write-wins by event `updatedAt` — a stale phone copy must not hide a newer save or resurrect a delete.
- Pull cloud when opening Calendar and when the app returns to the foreground. Pull-to-refresh is backup, not the only sync.
- Google pull stays authoritative for Google-linked events. Connect-once / disconnect-all-devices (`user_google_oauth`). UI label stays **Connected**.

